# scenario: resume-in-initialize
# doc: resume-in-initialize.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude resume-in-initialize.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: initialize returns resume before any provider launched, so no session exists
# given: the resume raises LifecycleResumeWithoutSession and ends the run with no catch event and no finalize
# given: the provider never launches
event initialize
exit 1
